{{Rootnotes
| name = Hoodwink Sharpshooter
| desc = Does not apply the {{M|knockback}} component when affected by [[Root]] sources.
}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Sharpshooter icon0}}
| desc = Hoodwink charges up and fires a deadly bolt from her crossbow, dealing heavy damage, break and slow to an enemy Hero.  The damage and debuff duration scale up to max after 3 seconds, and the bolt is fired automatically after 5 seconds.<br><br>Hoodwink is knocked backwards for a distance of 350 from the force of the shot. Creeps hit by the bolt are damaged for half the values.
}}
* {{Symbol|Affect|Self}} {{Symbol|fx|v}}
** Has a min and max {{M|cast backswing}} of {{#expr:{{#var:Sharpshooter cast backswing}}-{{#var:Sharpshooter value5}}}} ‒ {{#var:Sharpshooter cast backswing}} seconds respectively.
** The cast backswing starts upon cast, so the effective backswing depends on when Sharpshooter was released.

* {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
** The {{M|turn rate}} is given as degrees per second, instead of radians per {{M|server tick}}.
*** Has a {{#expr:{{#explode:{{#var:Sharpshooter type1 value1}}|°}}*{{G|deg to turn rate}}}}-{{M|turn rate}} ({{Code|{{#expr:{{#explode:{{#var:Sharpshooter type1 value1}}|°}}*{{G|deg to rad}}}} [[Wikipedia:Radian|rad]]}}).

